<h1 class="chapter-title">CHAPTER 4: SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE & DESIGN</h1>

<h3 class="subsection-title">4.1 High-Level Architecture</h3>
VisionAssist AI implements a decoupled, event-driven Three-Tier Client-Server Architecture:
1. <strong>Presentation Tier (Client):</strong> Single Page Application (SPA) built on React that handles user interaction, accessibility rendering, speech recognition/synthesis, and client-side computer vision inference.
2. <strong>Application Logic Tier (Server):</strong> Node.js Express server providing RESTful endpoints, exam evaluation logic, authentication, OTP verification, and logging.
3. <strong>Data Persistence Tier (Storage):</strong> Cloud MongoDB Atlas NoSQL database with local browser `localStorage` mirroring for resilient offline failover.

